+REXCVAR_DEFINE_INT32(present_fullscreen_small_mode, 0, "UI/Presenter",
+                     "Session 95: in fullscreen, use the smallest display mode of the desktop's shape and refresh rate that "
+                     "is at least this many lines high and that high x 16/9 wide (720: a 2736x1824 panel may take 1368x912), "
+                     "so the display's scaler does the upscale in place of the paint. The picture size is not changed. "
+                     "SDL restores the desktop's mode at exit and when the window loses focus. 0 = off (the desktop's mode)");
+
